      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "CEQA Notice of Exemption lists APNs 034-194-030 and 034-194-040, 0.64 acres; demolition of two commercial buildings of about 11,300 square feet; an eight-story building with 94 units including 10 very low income units, 7,286 square feet of ground-floor commercial, 114 parking spaces on levels 1-3; and a tentative parcel map merging five parcels. It names Mounir Kardosh, President, Nazareth Enterprises, as property owner.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003064"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "County parcel layer shows 034-194-040 (245 7th Ave) owned by Moore Richard A & Ann M Trs; 034-194-030 is owned by Nazareth Vista LLC.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003065",
        "SRC-001052"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "SF YIMBY (May 2025) reports 84 feet, nearly 160,000 square feet total, 117 car and 33 bicycle spaces, and demolition of the former Kelly-Moore Paints store. City page lists the units as for-rent.",
